  "title": "Grilled Buffalo Chicken Thighs with Blue Cheese Slaw",
  "description": "This grilled buffalo chicken thigh recipe delivers all of the buffalo wing flavor you love in the appetizer but served dinner-style. Blue cheese slaw completes the dish.",
